# the knobs a MOD lane holds (docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-26-mod-track-design.md; the user's tries on the FM-1,
# 2026-11-26): with MOD VIEW on they show the value playing, moving with the glide, the knob's own a tick on the bar
# (the Master filter page's knob and its curve, T2's Filter page); turned by hand, the knob takes over from the value
# playing (not from its own: it jumped); the hand's value is what MOD gives back when it lets go ("-", the mute)
wait 300
preset 2 acid_line acid
pat 2 1 16 1 60 0
notes 2 1 1 0.5 100 A1
knob 2 cut 40
# P1: 16 steps a beat each; the drums' filter from 60 (LP 15 kHz) down to 20 over 8 beats, T2's cutoff 40 to 100
modpat 1 16 4
modlane 1 mst dfilt glide
modval 1 mst dfilt 1 60 9 20
modlane 1 2 cut glide
modval 1 2 cut 1 40 9 100
scenemod 1 1
expect mst.dfilt 64
tap PLAY
bars 0.5
expect modpat 1
expect mlive.dfilt <53
expect mlive.dfilt >47
# Master filter (GLO, SELECT 5 from Mix): KNOB 1 the drums' filter as it plays, its own (64, off) a tick
tap GLO
turn SELECT 5
expect page Master_filter
expect knobnum1 <53
expect knobtick1 65
wait 100
shot modknob_mfilt.png
# T2's Filter page: the cutoff playing (~70), its own (40) a tick
track 2
expect trk 2
tap ENV
turn SELECT 1
expect page Filter
expect knobnum1 >60
expect knobtick1 41
wait 100
shot modknob_filter.png
# MOD VIEW off (Setup): the knob's own again (the value playing a dot, as a lock's), no tick
tap GLO
turn SELECT 3
expect page Setup
tap SEL
row MOD VIEW
turn ALGO -1
wait 50
tap HOME
wait 50
tap ENV
turn SELECT 1
expect page Filter
expect knobnum1 40
expect knobtick1 0
tap GLO
tap SEL
row MOD VIEW
turn ALGO 1
wait 50
tap HOME
wait 50
expect modview 1
# the hand on the Master filter page: KNOB 1 from the value playing, not from its own (64, off)
turn SELECT -3
expect page Master_filter
spin K1 -2
wait 50
expect mst.dfilt <36
expect mst.dfilt >20
expect mlive.dfilt -1
# T2's cutoff on its Filter page: the same
tap ENV
turn SELECT 1
expect page Filter
spin K1 3
wait 50
expect par2.cut >70
# the MOD track muted (Arrange, black key 11): the knobs' values back (the hands' here), not frozen
tap HOME
wait 50
tapkey b10
wait 100
expect mute 1024
expect live2.cut -1
expect mlive.dfilt -1
expect par2.cut >70
bars 1
expect live2.cut -1
tapkey b10
wait 100
expect mute 0
# back on: the lanes take their targets at their next values (bar 4: step 1 again); then "-": the knobs' again
bars 3
expect mlive.dfilt >30
expect live2.cut >30
scenemod 1 -
bars 1.1
expect smod1 0
expect modpat 0
expect live2.cut -1
expect mlive.dfilt -1
expect par2.cut >70
expect mst.dfilt <36
